WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.041 --> 00:00:09.075
OH

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:10.977
I,

00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:11.544
I,

00:00:11.978 --> 00:00:13.146
I THINK WE JUST MADE SOME
HISTORY.

00:00:21.754 --> 00:00:22.388
SO,

00:00:22.589 --> 00:00:23.523
SOUTH CAROLINA.

00:00:24.523 --> 00:00:24.891
YOU

00:00:25.792 --> 00:00:28.862
YOU HAVE SHOWN THE NATION WHAT
IS POSSIBLE.

00:00:32.598 --> 00:00:35.001
YOU HAVE SHOWN THE NATION THAT
IN THIS

00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:37.870
ERA OF PARTISAN DIVIDES,

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:40.172
OF VITRIOL AND NAME-CALLING.

00:00:41.607 --> 00:00:45.778
IN A POLITICS DOMINATED BY
BILLIONAIRES AND SPECIAL
INTEREST GROUPS AND

00:00:45.878 --> 00:00:49.783
INSIDERS IN WASHINGTON DC THAT
WE WILL NOT BOW DOWN.

00:00:53.986 --> 00:00:58.525
THAT WE WILL NOT BACK DOWN AND
WE WILL CHART OUR OWN COURSE.

00:01:02.662 --> 00:01:07.267
YOU HAVE SHOWN THE NATION THAT
WE CAN COME TOGETHER TO DEFEND
SOUTH CAROLINA.

00:01:10.335 --> 00:01:15.708
AND TODAY YOU HAVE ELECTED A
SENATOR THAT WILL ALWAYS PUT
SOUTH CAROLINA FIRST.

00:01:21.447 --> 00:01:22.615
NOT ONLY THAT,

00:01:22.715 --> 00:01:24.183
BUT YOU HAVE ELECTED

00:01:24.283 --> 00:01:26.219
THE FIRST PEDIATRICIAN.

00:01:27.319 --> 00:01:28.421
UNITED STATES SENATE

00:01:35.127 --> 00:01:35.662
THAT'S RIGHT.

00:01:40.332 --> 00:01:45.004
THE FIRST WOMAN THAT SOUTH
CAROLINA HAS EVER SENT TO THE
UNITED STATES SENATE.

00:01:54.013 --> 00:01:55.948
SO FROM THE BOTTOM OF MY HEART,

00:01:56.049 --> 00:01:56.749
THANK YOU.

00:01:58.150 --> 00:02:00.186
I WANNA START BY THANKING

00:02:00.286 --> 00:02:01.354
DAENE GRAHAM

00:02:01.854 --> 00:02:03.389
FOR HER PUBLIC SERVICE

00:02:03.489 --> 00:02:05.858
AND HER LOVE FOR SOUTH CAROLINA,

00:02:05.958 --> 00:02:08.328
AND I WISH HER AND HER FAMILY
WELL.

00:02:08.895 --> 00:02:09.628
AND I,

00:02:09.995 --> 00:02:11.296
AND I JUST,

00:02:11.630 --> 00:02:15.401
AND I JUST SPOKE WITH HER AND
SHE CONGRATULATED ME ON OUR
VICTORY TONIGHT.

00:02:22.408 --> 00:02:23.977
AND TO THE HEARTBEAT,

00:02:24.244 --> 00:02:26.145
THE HEARTBEAT OF OUR CAMPAIGN,

00:02:26.245 --> 00:02:27.580
OUR VOLUNTEERS.

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:33.952
WHO WORKED THEIR TAILS OFF AND
NEVER STOPPED BELIEVING,

00:02:34.053 --> 00:02:34.553
THANK YOU,

00:02:34.654 --> 00:02:35.121
THANK YOU,

00:02:35.321 --> 00:02:35.955
THANK YOU.

00:02:37.423 --> 00:02:39.859
AND TO OUR STATE PARTY
CHAIRWOMAN,

00:02:39.959 --> 00:02:41.027
CRYSTAL SPAIN.

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:45.230
THE FIRST

00:02:45.464 --> 00:02:47.901
BLACK WOMAN TO LEAD OUR STATE'S
PARTY.

00:02:53.205 --> 00:02:54.840
WHO INVESTED IN THIS RACE,

00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:55.908
WHO BELIEVED IN US,

00:02:56.008 --> 00:02:57.010
WHO BELIEVED IN ME,

00:02:57.110 --> 00:02:58.645
AND WORKED TIRELESSLY,

00:02:58.745 --> 00:03:03.983
TIRELESSLY TO BUILD A STRONGER
SOUTH CAROLINA ACROSS ALL 46
COUNTIES.

00:03:04.283 --> 00:03:04.550
THANK YOU,

00:03:04.650 --> 00:03:05.151
CRYSTAL.

00:03:08.987 --> 00:03:10.890
AND TO MY DEAR FRIEND JAMIE
HARRISON,

00:03:10.990 --> 00:03:12.725
WE WOULD NOT BE HERE WITHOUT
YOU.

00:03:13.292 --> 00:03:14.093
THANK YOU SO MUCH.

00:03:18.164 --> 00:03:22.267
TO ALL OF OUR INCREDIBLE STAFF
WHO POURED THEIR HEARTS AND
SOULS INTO THIS RACE,

00:03:22.368 --> 00:03:23.036
THANK YOU.

00:03:26.004 --> 00:03:29.074
TO THE THOUSANDS OF PEOPLE WHO
WELCOMED US INTO THEIR HOMES,

00:03:29.174 --> 00:03:29.775
THEIR CHURCHES,

00:03:29.875 --> 00:03:30.543
THEIR BUSINESSES,

00:03:30.643 --> 00:03:32.311
AND ONTO THEIR FRONT PORCHES,

00:03:32.411 --> 00:03:33.813
THANK YOU SO MUCH.

00:03:36.549 --> 00:03:37.850
AND TO THE REPUBLICANS,

00:03:38.051 --> 00:03:39.051
INDEPENDENTS,

00:03:39.151 --> 00:03:41.721
AND DEMOCRATS WHO TOOK A CHANCE
ON A PEDIATRICIAN

00:03:41.988 --> 00:03:43.389
AND A MOM OF THREE.

00:03:47.893 --> 00:03:51.096
BECAUSE YOU BELIEVE THAT SOUTH
CAROLINA SHOULD COME FIRST,

00:03:51.197 --> 00:03:51.898
THANK YOU.

00:03:54.633 --> 00:03:55.401
SOUTH CAROLINA,

00:03:55.501 --> 00:03:56.936
MY NAME MAY HAVE BEEN ON THE
BALLOT,

00:03:57.036 --> 00:03:58.737
BUT THIS VICTORY DOESN'T BELONG
TO ME.

00:03:58.837 --> 00:04:00.506
IT BELONGS TO ALL OF YOU.

00:04:03.609 --> 00:04:04.543
BECAUSE TONIGHT,

00:04:04.644 --> 00:04:07.446
WE HERE IN SOUTH CAROLINA SENT A
CLEAR MESSAGE

00:04:07.546 --> 00:04:10.816
THAT THIS SENATE SEAT DOES NOT
BELONG TO ONE FAMILY,

00:04:11.083 --> 00:04:12.017
ONE PARTY,

00:04:12.251 --> 00:04:14.087
OR TO WASHINGTON DC.

00:04:21.260 --> 00:04:23.996
IT BELONGS TO YOU AND IT ALWAYS
WILL.

00:04:24.597 --> 00:04:27.399
WE EMBARKED ON THIS JOURNEY OVER
18 MONTHS AGO,

00:04:27.499 --> 00:04:29.935
AND WHILE IT WAS LONG AND
EXHAUSTING,

00:04:30.836 --> 00:04:34.373
AND THERE WERE PLENTY OF DAYS
WHEN I WAS RUNNING ON NOTHING
BUT PROTEIN BARS,

00:04:34.473 --> 00:04:35.007
COFFEE,

00:04:35.474 --> 00:04:37.309
AND GIANT DIET COKES FROM GAS
STATIONS.

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:40.279
IT TRULY HAS BEEN THE JOURNEY OF
A LIFETIME.

00:04:40.680 --> 00:04:43.883
WE TOOK THIS CAMPAIGN TO EVERY
SINGLE ONE OF OUR 46 COUNTIES,

00:04:43.983 --> 00:04:46.451
FROM SMALL TOWNS AND MAIN
STREETS TO FARMS

00:04:46.551 --> 00:04:47.720
AND OUR RURAL COMMUNITIES,

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:50.689
FROM THE BLUE RIDGE MOUNTAINS IN
THE UPSTATE TO THE SWAMPS,

00:04:50.789 --> 00:04:52.825
THE LITERAL SWAMPS IN THE
MIDLANDS,

00:04:53.058 --> 00:04:55.395
TO THE BEACHES HERE IN THE LOW
COUNTRY.

00:04:59.565 --> 00:05:03.369
I SAT ON THE BACK OF A PICKUP
TRUCK WITH AN 8TH GENERATION

00:05:03.469 --> 00:05:06.939
FARMER IN BARNWELL WHO TOLD ME
THAT IT NOW COST HER $1900.

00:05:37.136 --> 00:05:37.637
Y'ALL,

00:05:38.070 --> 00:05:39.439
I THOUGHT MY FARMER FRIEND WAS
HERE.

00:05:41.473 --> 00:05:45.111
SHE TOLD ME IT COST $1900 TO
FILL UP HER TRACTOR WITH DIESEL

00:05:45.211 --> 00:05:48.313
AND THAT TANK OF GAS WILL ONLY
LAST HER FOR 3 DAYS.

00:05:48.547 --> 00:05:51.450
AND THAT FARM THAT'S BEEN IN HER
SOUTH CAROLINA FAMILY FOR EIGHT

00:05:51.550 --> 00:05:55.254
GENERATIONS MIGHT NOT LAST
ANOTHER YEAR OR TWO IF THINGS
DON'T CHANGE.

00:05:55.354 --> 00:05:57.857
I STOOD SHOULDER TO SHOULDER
WITH VETERANS IN RIDGELAND,

00:05:57.957 --> 00:06:00.592
TEARS IN THEIR EYES AS THEY TOLD
ME THAT THEY'VE LOST

00:06:00.826 --> 00:06:02.194
FRIENDS TO SUICIDE,

00:06:02.395 --> 00:06:03.329
THAT THEIR FIGHT

00:06:03.429 --> 00:06:05.064
FOR THEIR BENEFITS THAT THEY'VE
EARNED,

00:06:05.164 --> 00:06:09.435
AND THEIR FEAR OF ANOTHER
GENERATION BEING SENT OFF TO A
RECKLESS WAR.

00:06:12.772 --> 00:06:15.307
I'VE SPOKEN TO SENIORS WHO'VE
WORKED THEIR ENTIRE LIVES,

00:06:15.407 --> 00:06:16.075
RAISED THEIR FAMILY,

00:06:16.175 --> 00:06:17.610
AND DID EVERYTHING

00:06:17.710 --> 00:06:18.478
RIGHT,

00:06:19.345 --> 00:06:22.214
ONLY TO FIND THEMSELVES
STRUGGLING TO GET BY ON THEIR
SOCIAL SECURITY CHECKS.

00:06:22.481 --> 00:06:26.018
I'VE SEEN NEIGHBORS LOOKING OUT
FOR EACH OTHER REGARDLESS OF
POLITICAL PARTY,

00:06:26.118 --> 00:06:29.388
FAMILIES COMING TOGETHER TO HELP
EACH OTHER THROUGH HARD TIMES,

00:06:29.621 --> 00:06:32.424
AND CHURCH CONGREGATIONS OPENING
THEIR HEARTS AND DOORS

00:06:32.524 --> 00:06:35.027
TO ANYONE WHO NEEDS A HELPING
HAND.

00:06:35.727 --> 00:06:37.563
THIS IS THE SOUTH CAROLINA THAT
I KNOW.

00:06:37.663 --> 00:06:41.200
THIS IS THE SOUTH CAROLINA THAT
I AM PROUD TO CALL HOME.

00:06:46.772 --> 00:06:48.908
AND THIS IS THE SOUTH CAROLINA
THAT I WILL FIGHT

00:06:49.008 --> 00:06:52.412
FOR EVERY SINGLE DAY IN THE
UNITED STATES SENATE.

00:06:57.683 --> 00:07:00.919
AND TO THE SOUTH CAROLINIANS WHO
DID NOT VOTE FOR ME,

00:07:01.019 --> 00:07:03.789
I KNOW WE MAY NOT AGREE ON
EVERYTHING,

00:07:03.889 --> 00:07:06.292
AND I MAY NOT HAVE EARNED YOUR
VOTE TODAY,

00:07:06.392 --> 00:07:07.960
BUT I WANT YOU TO KNOW THIS,

00:07:08.160 --> 00:07:10.062
I WILL BE YOUR SENATOR TOO.

00:07:13.833 --> 00:07:14.834
I WILL LISTEN TO YOU,

00:07:14.934 --> 00:07:16.435
I WILL SHOW UP FOR YOU,

00:07:16.535 --> 00:07:21.473
AND I WILL FIGHT JUST AS HARD
FOR YOU AND YOUR CHILDREN AS I
WOULD MY OWN.

00:07:21.874 --> 00:07:23.676
THAT'S THE KIND OF SENATOR THAT
I'LL BE.

00:07:27.580 --> 00:07:29.782
I'LL BE AN INDEPENDENT VOICE WHO
WILL WORK WITH ANYONE,

00:07:30.015 --> 00:07:31.049
REPUBLICAN OR DEMOCRAT,

00:07:31.149 --> 00:07:33.386
TO DO WHAT'S RIGHT FOR SOUTH
CAROLINA.

00:07:33.686 --> 00:07:37.356
I WILL BE A BRICK WALL BETWEEN
WASHINGTON DC AND SOUTH
CAROLINA,

00:07:37.457 --> 00:07:39.892
EVEN WHEN IT MEANS STANDING UP
TO MY OWN PARTY.

00:07:42.928 --> 00:07:46.499
NOBODY IN WASHINGTON RECRUITED
ME TO RUN.

00:07:49.368 --> 00:07:53.639
NOBODY HANDED ME A SEAT IN THE
UNITED STATES SENATE.

00:07:56.074 --> 00:07:58.544
AND NOBODY WROTE ME A SCRIPT.

00:07:59.078 --> 00:07:59.578
I,

00:07:59.811 --> 00:08:00.213
I,

00:08:00.446 --> 00:08:02.882 size:88% position:44%
I NO ONE IN WASHINGTON

00:08:03.549 --> 00:08:04.016
ANYTHING.

00:08:04.116 --> 00:08:05.985
I OWE SOUTH CAROLINA

00:08:06.619 --> 00:08:07.019
EVERYTHING.

00:08:12.024 --> 00:08:14.459
AND THAT'S EXACTLY WHO I'M GONNA
ANSWER TO.

00:08:14.559 --> 00:08:17.596
NOW I NEVER IMAGINED THAT I
WOULD END UP IN POLITICS.

00:08:17.830 --> 00:08:18.830
SINCE I WAS 4,

00:08:18.931 --> 00:08:21.333
I'VE ONLY EVER DREAMED OF
BECOMING A DOCTOR,

00:08:21.433 --> 00:08:23.335
AND FOR THE PAST 20 YEARS,

00:08:23.435 --> 00:08:26.538
I'VE DEDICATED MY LIFE TO CARING
FOR SICK AND INJURED CHILDREN.

00:08:26.939 --> 00:08:31.610
BUT WHAT I SAW AS A PEDIATRICIAN
AND WHAT I'VE EXPERIENCED
RAISING MY OWN 3 CHILDREN

00:08:31.810 --> 00:08:34.847
MADE ME REALIZE THAT I COULDN'T
JUST SIT ON THE SIDELINES
ANYMORE.

00:08:34.947 --> 00:08:38.150
I WATCHED AS INSURANCE COMPANIES
STOOD BETWEEN SICK CHILDREN

00:08:38.250 --> 00:08:39.651
AND THE CARE THAT THEY NEED.

00:08:40.118 --> 00:08:43.022
I'VE SEEN HOW DECISIONS MADE IN
WASHINGTON AFFECT THE

00:08:43.122 --> 00:08:45.624
LIVES OF THE CHILDREN AND
FAMILIES I'VE CARED FOR,

00:08:45.925 --> 00:08:47.593
AND THAT'S WHY I DECIDED TO RUN,

00:08:48.027 --> 00:08:52.131
BECAUSE I BELIEVE WE HAVE A
RESPONSIBILITY TO LEAVE OUR
CHILDREN SOMETHING BETTER

00:08:52.231 --> 00:08:53.666
THAN WHAT WE INHERITED.

00:08:56.869 --> 00:09:00.139
A SOUTH CAROLINA WHERE A FAMILY
CAN AFFORD TO FILL UP A GAS
TANK,

00:09:00.239 --> 00:09:01.774 size:84% position:42%
PUT GROCERIES HE TABLE,

00:09:01.874 --> 00:09:03.943
AND GET THE CHILDCARE THEY NEED
WITHOUT

00:09:04.276 --> 00:09:05.878
WORRYING ABOUT GOING BROKE.

00:09:06.478 --> 00:09:08.847
WHEN DECISIONS WHERE DECISIONS
ABOUT OUR COMMUNITIES

00:09:08.947 --> 00:09:10.582
ARE MADE BY THE PEOPLE WHO LIVE

00:09:10.682 --> 00:09:11.983
IN OUR COMMUNITIES,

00:09:12.084 --> 00:09:15.021
NOT THE BILLIONAIRES OR DATA
CENTER COMPANIES IN WASHINGTON
DC.

00:09:18.023 --> 00:09:22.595
AND WHERE THE NEXT GENERATION
CAN AFFORD TO BUILD A LIFE AND
RAISE A FAMILY HERE.

00:09:22.695 --> 00:09:24.664
THAT'S THE FUTURE THAT I'M
FIGHTING FOR.

00:09:27.934 --> 00:09:30.169
AND I KNOW THAT THE WORK AHEAD
WON'T BE EASY,

00:09:30.269 --> 00:09:34.306
BUT AFTER 18 MONTHS IN 46
COUNTIES AND EVERYTHING WE'VE
BEEN THROUGH

00:09:34.606 --> 00:09:35.273
TOGETHER,

00:09:35.607 --> 00:09:37.710
I'VE NEVER BEEN MORE CERTAIN OF
ONE THING.

00:09:38.844 --> 00:09:41.914
SOUTH CAROLINA'S BEST DAYS ARE
STILL AHEAD OF US.

00:10:03.768 --> 00:10:07.372
AND I PROMISE YOU I'M GONNA GIVE
YOU EVERYTHING I HAVE TO MAKE
SURE WE GET THERE.

00:10:07.472 --> 00:10:09.442
TO BUILD A SOUTH CAROLINA YOU
CAN AFFORD,

00:10:09.542 --> 00:10:12.477
A SOUTH CAROLINA YOU CAN ALWAYS
BE PROUD TO CALL HOME,

00:10:12.577 --> 00:10:15.347
AND A SOUTH CAROLINA THAT WILL
ALWAYS COME FIRST.

00:10:15.681 --> 00:10:17.449
SO THANK YOU FOR BELIEVING IN
ME.

00:10:17.683 --> 00:10:20.186
THANK YOU FOR MAKING HISTORY
WITH ME

00:10:20.519 --> 00:10:21.220
TONIGHT.

00:10:21.586 --> 00:10:22.054
AND,

00:10:22.321 --> 00:10:23.856
AND MOST IMPORTANTLY,

00:10:23.956 --> 00:10:27.225
WE HAD TO MOVE THIS PART TO THE
END SO I WOULDN'T BE A
BLUBBERING IDIOT UP HERE.

00:10:27.692 --> 00:10:28.460
MOST IMPORTANTLY,

00:10:28.561 --> 00:10:29.227
THANK YOU

00:10:29.327 --> 00:10:30.196
TO MY FAMILY.

00:10:35.801 --> 00:10:39.572
TO MY PARENTS WHO HAVE STOOD BY
ME EVERY STEP OF THE WAY.

00:10:41.607 --> 00:10:42.574
AND TO MY,

00:10:42.674 --> 00:10:43.943
TO MY 3 CHILDREN.

00:10:51.317 --> 00:10:53.152
THANK YOU FOR EVERY HUG,

00:10:53.385 --> 00:10:55.521
EVERY WORD OF ENCOURAGEMENT.

00:10:56.621 --> 00:10:57.723
I LOVE YOU MORE.

00:10:57.823 --> 00:10:59.558
I LOVE YOU MORE THAN WORDS,

00:11:00.726 --> 00:11:02.561
THAN WORDS WILL EVER EXPRESS.

00:11:02.861 --> 00:11:04.130
I'M SO PROUD OF YOU GUYS.

00:11:10.502 --> 00:11:14.974
AND BEING YOUR MOM WILL ALWAYS
BE THE MOST IMPORTANT JOB I
HAVE.

00:11:19.178 --> 00:11:19.545
RIGHT.

00:11:20.613 --> 00:11:20.913
ALL RIGHT.

00:11:22.114 --> 00:11:24.816
AND I HOPE THAT WHEN YOU LOOK
BACK ON THIS MOMENT,

00:11:25.016 --> 00:11:25.751
ALL THREE OF YOU,

00:11:25.851 --> 00:11:27.519
I HOPE THAT YOU REMEMBER
SOMETHING

00:11:27.853 --> 00:11:30.456
THAT YOU CAN STAND UP FOR WHAT
YOU BELIEVE IN.

00:11:31.556 --> 00:11:34.326
THAT YOU CAN SPEAK OUT WHEN
SOMETHING ISN'T RIGHT.

00:11:35.627 --> 00:11:37.396
AND NO MATTER HOW BIG THE
CHALLENGE,

00:11:37.496 --> 00:11:40.499
YOU SHOULD NEVER BE AFRAID TO
TRY TO MAKE THINGS BETTER.

00:11:46.004 --> 00:11:49.775
BECAUSE YOU NEVER KNOW WHAT'S
POSSIBLE IF YOU'RE WILLING TO
TRY.

00:11:55.013 --> 00:11:56.348
SOUTH CAROLINA,

00:11:56.849 --> 00:11:58.250
I LOVE YOU.

00:11:58.584 --> 00:11:59.651
THANK YOU

00:11:59.952 --> 00:12:00.986
AND GOOD NIGHT.

